2. Check that `run_csv.py` and `run_new.py` save with `encoding="utf-8-sig"`.
3. Optional: test a single-pin rule (POI only when `in_locality`, else locality centroid) on `val_clean.parquet`, never on the frozen test.
4. Confirm `landmark_rows_fresh30.csv` was created from the real data.